      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can still confirm as of Ver. 2025.2.1 Build 396. However, double clicking *does kind of* work, but you have to absolutely MASH the buttons to get it to respond. I suspect it’s some kind of input issue on a touch screen.\n\nThis issue seems non-present when using a controller/gamepad as you would on VRC Desktop. Tested with an 8BitDo Micro, Sony DualSense and Nintendo Joy-Cons.\n\nTested with an iPad Pro M2 (2022, 11in), iOS 18.3.\n\nAttached is a video showcasing me activating the quick menu navigation features of the UI.",
